cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use simrun, please cite it as below."
title: "simrun: a runner of simulation workflows on a k3s cluster"
abstract: "simrun runs simulation workflows on a small k3s cluster with Argo Workflows and Kueue: people and agents submit workflows of tasks together with the working trees of their model and libraries, split tasks spread their units over idle servers and give them back to runs of higher priority, the memory of the pods is learned from earlier runs, and every run keeps its results and provenance in a shared run store. A command line, an HTTP API and an MCP server for agents submit, follow and compare the runs."
type: software
